00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:04.010
The air flow through the pipes is controlled
by valves which are wired.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:05.930
To the machine's electrical panel.

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:09.320
That electrical panel, consisting of.

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:10.010
Relays.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:16.610
Pumps, gas analyzers and a touch screen is
