00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:25.730
The entire operation.

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:30.630
The computer even has wi fi, enabling.

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:33.060
The apple grower to remotely operate.

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:35.070
And monitor the machine from a.

